{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"7a86fa094b28a2fa9de7ff59eb46ecd5280be9e65b3ad7aa2f795a4859de6eae"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:79a2978b761eb44c69655b498537ede65b8d03bdf366afd4493b2f1288c29ff5","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"building custom projects","evidence":"[D23:11 | 9:39 am on 15 October, 2023] Dave: Yeah, Calvin! The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e4f8f8f8-dd3e-579b-92cc-e1720b38cd81","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:865f55f3d85460d9159f3cb603362170c1bd00bb17989d335494dc52c5ab07ca","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activity does Dave find fulfilling, similar to Calvin's passion for music festivals?","referenceAnswer":"fixing things","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"865f55f3d85460d9159f3cb603362170c1bd00bb17989d335494dc52c5ab07ca"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}